15: ## Reference Documentation
16: 
17: Fetch these resources before generating or editing workflow files, or when answering syntax questions. First resolve this skill's directory, then use the fetch script in its `scripts/` directory. It is implemented using Node.js and caches responses using ETags for efficiency:
