100: 
101: Fetches a URL with HTTP caching (ETags + Cache-Control/Expires).
102: Default TTL: ${DEFAULT_TTL_SECONDS / 60} minutes.
103: Cache is stored in: ${CACHE_DIRECTORY}/`);
104:     process.exit(url ? 0 : 1);
105:   }
